WEBVTT

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:06.950
One A.M.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:09.950
Airspace above Russia

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.920
Appetizer... fish... meat.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:18.670
I'm quite tired of eating French food.

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:21.970
It'd be nice if I could have some nice Japanese food right about now, but...

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:25.800
I can't say I've eaten a full course until I've had dessert, can I?

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.850
I'm just kidding.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:33.480
I guess I'll go take a shower now.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.770
It's been a while, after all.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.940
I have to stay hygienic or Sen won't like me anymore.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.460
Yagyuu Dojo

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:22.000
Listen up, everyone!

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:22.290
Yagyuu True Shadow Style

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:25.170
Do you understand what kind of a crisis we're in?!

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:30.130
We, Team Love Warriors, must make the contract as soon as possible!

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:36.140
Hey, you two, the leader's talking here. Listen up!

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:40.140
Your lack of motivation is ruining our teamwork and-

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.900
Let's go elsewhere.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:47.070
Indeed. I can't concentrate if she just shows up and starts shouting.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:50.320
How dare you ignore the team leader!

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:54.490
If you further disobey me, it'll count as a violation!

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:55.660
Go ahead.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.330
As you wish.

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:00.420
Will you die already?!

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:03.330
Hanzou-san, weren't you a masochist?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.550
No, I'm a hella masochist.

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.720
Kissing with Matabei-san and Hanzou-san, eh...?

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:15.640
They did tell me to make the contract before Yoshihiko-sama came back, but...

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:19.230
I know it's you, Jyuubei. I told you I'm busy in the morning, so I can't play.

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:21.100
It's not Onee-sama.

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:21.690
Gisen!

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:24.690
I wanted to consult you on something, Master.

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:29.150
Why do you have to get so close to me when all you want is consultation?

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.400
Is it bad?

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:32.320
Not bad...

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:33.950
It's just weird!

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:43.000
How are they?

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.750
No good, they can't make up their minds.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:49.840
Yoshihiko will return in a week.

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.420
They have to make the contract by then.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.840
We can force them to kiss him,

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:57.470
but after <i>that</i>...

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:00.680
Yukki, have you seen Onii-chan?

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:01.810
He's not here?

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:04.810
Last time I looked, he was cleaning the yard.

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.060
That's strange.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:09.360
Gittan was looking for him with me but she disappeared too.

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:11.320
Gisen?!

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.320
Charcoal-Making Shed

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.950
Why'd you bring me all the way over here?

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:18.870
Now nobody else can come in.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:19.330
<b>Today's Challenge</b>

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:21.080
Are you planning to sandwich me again?!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:25.500
Master, I wish to have a serious conversation with you.

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:32.760
I think that instead of waiting for the samurai to ask,  you may actively pursue them instead.

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:37.300
I think that there might be a method like that.

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:39.850
Gisen's right.

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:42.770
With Yukimura,

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.520
with Senhime-sama...

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:46.100
Both times, I...

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.650
It's embarrassing for the samurai and general just the same.

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:53.400
Since I'm the man, I should be the one-

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:56.740
So, take a look at this.

00:04:56.740 --> 00:05:00.580
This document has the proper relationship between a general and a samurai written in its pages.

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:05.960
Spring Fever Diary
It depicts the physical relations between a general and a samurai.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.040
Spring Fever Diary
Of course, this isn't an item for sale on the general market.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:09.460
Of course, this isn't an item for sale on the general market.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:15.510
This is a test print, created by an individual and exchanged on the black market-

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:18.340
Did you bring me here just to show me that book?!

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.140
I'm busy so I'm going back!

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.720
How about sleeping with them?

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:26.440
A general and samurai should be connected by trust and bonding.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:31.320
Jyuubei Onee-sama's words made quite the impression in my heart.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:36.490
I was thinking that trust and bonding could be created by contact of the flesh.

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:39.160
By contact of the flesh...

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:39.450
Imagining

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:42.080
Hanzou-san, Matabei-san... sleeping with them...
Imagining

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.500
Hanzou-san, Matabei-san... sleeping with them...

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:47.000
Like I could do that!

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.960
I can't even kiss them...

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:49.920
Then...

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:53.750
Why are you stripping?!

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:57.050
I was going to have you practice with my body.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:06:00.050
No way! Never!

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.010
Are you sure?

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:07.270
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:10.560
I know I have to hurry up and make the contract.

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:15.740
But I want to understand Matabei-san and Hanzou-san as samurai.

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:18.400
I feel that the contract should happen after that.

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:20.030
Really?

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:21.990
Then I guess I have to resort to this.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.120
Gisen, that eye-

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:26.120
Playtime's over.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:31.080
Ten minutes later

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.500
Ohii-sama, over here!
Ten minutes later

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:35.170
The only place I can think of is the charcoal-making shed!

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:38.420
Wait, Hanzou-san! Senhime-san!

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:42.510
Those two...! I won't forgive them if they are sandwiching again!

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:43.180
Over there!

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:45.600
Gisen! Muneakira!

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:51.020
Both of you, come out if you're here

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:53.360
or you're going to feel some pain!

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.070
Looks like they aren't here, either.

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:56.780
Yeah...

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:57.860
Let's go back.

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:00.450
Yukimura's group might've found them already.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:02.870
Muneakira!

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:05.790
Found you!

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:09.540
Onii-chan, Gittan! What are you doing here?

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.500
Muneakira, kill her!

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:17.090
Jyuubei-san!

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:21.680
Onii-chan, Gittan...

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.470
What's wrong?

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.470
Are they around?

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:25.890
No. I can't find them.

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:28.720
They don't seem to be on the premises...

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.230
Found you!

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:39.940
What are you doing?!

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:41.950
That's what <i>we</i> should be asking!

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:43.490
What were you doing?

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:46.740
Do you <i>really</i> want to know?

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:48.580
Okay, fine, I'll tell you.

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:50.660
We don't have time to waste dealing with idiots.

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:52.580
W-Wait a moment!

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.420
Please, just listen for a moment!

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.460
What?! Hurry up.

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:06.140
I guess I should tell you! I, Kanetsugu, was taking an early look at my second home's loft area!

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:08.470
Looks like it was a waste of time after all.

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:09.310
Yes.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:14.230
If you take that kind of attitude, I'm not even going to give you enough floor space for a bed!

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:15.810
Shut up!

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:18.400
Cause any more ruckus and I'll knock you out again!

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:23.360
If you think you can knock me out so many times, you're greatly mistaken!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.820
I'm getting knocked out again...

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:27.700
Dojo, clear.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.920
Hanzou, now!

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:37.710
Jyuubei-san, hurry.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:40.590
Muneakira-san!

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:43.010
Onii-chan, what's wrong?

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:46.220
He may have ingested some kind of poison.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:46.340
Substance Response: None
He may have ingested some kind of poison.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:46.930
Substance Response: None

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.430
No substance response?

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:53.730
I can only conclude that it's a spiritual control of some kind.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.100
Jyuubei-san, this way!

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.440
Coward! Stop running and hiding, and fight me!

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:07.030
Seems like even a master samurai can't make a move with her general taken.

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:08.660
Ohii-sama!

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.870
Muneakira-san appears to be controlled!

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:15.790
You better not think that you'll get away with screwing up Muneakira!

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:25.050
I wanted to watch him drown in his lust; throwing away his trust, bonding, and all pride as a general...

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:28.720
But this general appears to be quite insistent on upholding his useless values.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:34.640
I wouldn't have any more time for the ritual, so I took the liberty of forcing this.

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:37.940
Gittan, why would you do such a horrible-

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:40.190
Jyuubei Onee-sama, it's all your fault.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:43.480
It's all because you made a contract with this man.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.950
I mean, for our master's ritual-

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.110
Silence!

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:50.620
Free Muneakira immediately and leave this place!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.790
And tell your master, Tokugawa Yoshihiko, this:

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:57.210
I won't forgive Onii-sama no matter what!

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.630
What's so funny?!

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:06.840
You thought my master was Tokugawa Yoshihiko?!

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:08.470
Laughable!

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:11.390
My master isn't something so minuscule!

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:13.310
He is a much more wonderful man.

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:16.810
Yes, the greatest man in Great Japan!

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:20.190
Jyuubei Onee-sama, you'd understand, wouldn't you?

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.480
Flowering Ignition!

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:33.700
Yagyuu Gisen, descending!

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:38.660
Gisen's a master samurai?

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:42.250
There's no mistaking it. Her power level's abnormally high!

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:44.670
Gittan...

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:45.840
Jyuubei?

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.300
Are you all right, Jyuubei-san?

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:51.090
Please, stop it, Gittan...

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:52.760
Onii-chan's suffering!

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:55.180
Onee-sama, please calm down.

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:59.480
This man no longer has any feelings of suffering left in him.

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:03.690
Gisen, as a master samurai, fight me fair and square!

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:06.230
I'll take care of that master samurai.

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:09.450
You have to steal Onee-sama's lips.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.990
You are no longer a general. You're Gisen's slave.

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:14.070
Onii-chan.
You are no longer a general. You're Gisen's slave.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:19.620
That kiss is one that dissolves the contract between the general and samurai.

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.420
Jyuubei Onee-sama will return to the state from which she was born,

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:26.000
and will actually make a contract with <i>him</i> this time.

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:27.920
This is...

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.130
Muneakira!

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:30.260
Onii-chan!

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:31.840
Gisen...

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:34.390
You're resisting my binding?

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:36.930
N-No way...!

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:39.270
That much bonding?

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:40.560
Onii-chan!

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:42.060
Impressive.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:45.480
I didn't think you'd capture Onee-sama's heart to that extent.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.820
I'll ease you into it later.

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:59.040
Hanzou, Jyuubei. Take care of Muneakira.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:11:59.950
Roger!

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.330
You've done it this time.

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.710
Ice Chaos Blade!

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:10.460
Ice Chaos Blade

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:11.300
She got through!

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:15.680
Nothing can capture a bolt of lightning!

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:18.060
And yet the world shall freeze!

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:19.770
Absolute Zero!

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:21.980
What?!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:28.570
Shatter!

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:35.030
Ohii-sama!

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:37.910
Are you all right, Ohii-sama!

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:41.620
We're both master samurai, yet what is this difference in power?

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:47.130
Even if you come at me with numbers, you cannot win against me.

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:51.800
So, Jyuubei Onee-sama. Please stop resisting and come here.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.970
No. I'll never give up!

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:55.470
Jyuubei...

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:58.890
Right now we don't have any support or strength...

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:01.930
But we do have

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:04.390
trust and bonding!

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.520
Good times.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:11.480
I must say, that's the epitome of a samurai's answer.

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:12.820
This voice is...

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:13.650
Could it be...

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:15.740
O-Onii-sama?!

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:18.820
Hey, Eyepatch over there.

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:22.120
Seems like you've been doing as you wish in my country.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.910
Tokugawa Yoshihiko, I take it.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.830
I don't like her.

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:31.170
Nia, it seems as though she needs some punishment.

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:45.020
My name is Charles D'Artagnan.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.900
I will eliminate you from Great Japan!

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:51.570
Is she also a master samurai or something?

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:52.320
Yes.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:55.240
But something's different...

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:58.610
Tokugawa's toy.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.000
Amazing.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:13.170
She's head-and-shoulders above Gisen in terms of power!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:15.590
Kill her, Nia.

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:28.480
The forbidden samurai, created by man...

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:29.650
Sounds fun!

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:32.110
That person's amazing...

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:34.530
Nia, here she comes. Do a mode change.

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:38.320
The world shall freeze once again!

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:39.740
Absolute Zero!

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:41.910
That move...!

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.540
Mode change.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:47.040
Fire.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.710
Freeze!

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:52.790
She got hit.

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:56.460
No, something's different this time.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.550
Nia.

00:14:57.550 --> 00:14:59.300
Maximum output!

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:02.300
What is it?

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:07.810
There is no way an evil being can remain in front of the flames of justice!

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:09.730
Inferno!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:18.320
Go, Nia! Burn her!

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:27.410
As I thought, <i>he</i> needs this power...!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:37.090
Did she win?

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:38.880
Is there any sign of Gisen?

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:39.970
None...

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:41.180
She ran.

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:45.260
Onii-sama, why? I thought you were coming back in a week.

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:49.520
I'm sure you know this: to fool the enemy, first fool your ally.

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:53.810
Sen. You're my ally, aren't you?

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:59.190
Well, it's all right. Let's have a nice chat later.

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:00.610
Nia, let's go.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:04.660
She overheated.

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.450
There's still a lot of room for improvement.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.460
I wanted to meet you, Natural.

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:22.050
Evening

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:24.720
Prisoners

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:27.010
Sit!

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:29.390
Hanzou, where's everyone?

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:33.350
I'm sorry. Yoshihiko-sama took them away.

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:34.480
Useless!

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:37.110
And you still call yourself a member of Team Love Warriors?!

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:38.400
Shut up.

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:41.030
Don't come out in the serious scenes.

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:43.320
Look who's talking.

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:46.530
Despite being a master samurai, they caught you like it was nothing!

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:49.410
It's because you were taken hostage all of a sudden!

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.540
Master samurai are the people who adapt and overcome such situations!

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:54.540
Don't move! Be quiet!

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:58.250
I'm not the loud one, that familiar Yukimura is!

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:02.300
I-Is it knock out time again?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:03.800
Stand down.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:07.430
You are...

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:08.430
Bugei Academy School Building

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:11.350
Underground Research Facility

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:13.810
I'm the shadow covering Great Japan?

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:16.690
That's a good one. I'm amused.

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:18.940
It's the most laughable misconception.

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:22.730
Are you saying you have nothing to do with the Spirited Away Incident, Onii-sama?

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.150
The Spirited Away Incident, eh?

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:28.120
Sen. Are you talking about this?

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:28.490
Izanami Project
Sen. Are you talking about this?

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.080
Izanami Project

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:32.740
There was such a large facility underneath the academy?!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:35.040
These girls are...!

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:39.670
Correct. These are the girls who have been spirited away.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:45.510
My general is working on the Izanami Project, on which the future of Great Japan is at stake.

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:47.880
What an exaggeration.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:50.470
But what you're doing is still a crime.

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:52.970
What's the purpose behind kidnapping people?

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:56.850
To artificially create master samurai.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:01.020
The kidnapped students are biological samples for it.

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:02.360
Am I wrong?

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:06.320
During the fight, you were recombining the energy within your body.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:09.740
Are you the result of the Izanami Project?

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:15.040
Yes. We have to create an artificial master samurai quickly.

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:18.080
Why? If there currently are master samurai in the country-

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:20.920
Great Japan's enemy is not the other countries of the world.

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:26.970
For a few hundred years now, the Tokugawa shogunate has waged a war, hidden from public view.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:29.220
The shadow covering Great Japan...

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:32.140
Izanami Project
Yes. It's like a ghost.

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:32.430
Izanami Project

00:18:32.430 --> 00:18:37.640
No matter how many times you defeat it, its raging soul comes back to haunt Great Japan.
Izanami Project

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:39.190
Izanami Project
Its name is... Amakusa Shirou!

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:40.560
Amakusa Shirou
Its name is... Amakusa Shirou!

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:46.530
Three hundred and some tens of years ago, he conspired to destroy the Tokugawa shogunate,

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:49.700
and incited a riot at Shimabara. He's the leader of a rogue cult!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:53.330
Wait! I've never heard of him or of such a riot!

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:59.330
The Tokugawa shogunate completely erased Amakusa and the riot from historical records.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.040
Why would they...?

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:06.380
It's because the fear and despair in the people becomes Amakusa's power.

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:09.260
The Great Famine of Tenpou.

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:11.010
The Kantou Earthquake.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.260
The Ooedo Air Raid.

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:17.770
These were all tragedies brought on by the reincarnated soul of Amakusa.

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:23.520
As such, Great Japan has been on the brink of destruction several times now.

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:27.030
Master samurai were the ones who stopped them.

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:27.610
Yes.

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:34.870
In the shadow of history, they fought Amakusa's soul, and forced him back into his slumber time after time.

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:40.750
However, for the past 20 years, people with the quality needed to become a master samurai stopped appearing.

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:45.250
There are only seven master samurai officially remaining in Great Japan.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.090
Indeed.

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:47.210
No.

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:49.670
The matter is much more serious.

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:51.050
What do you mean?

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.090
There aren't any.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:55.550
In Great Japan...

00:19:56.510 --> 00:20:00.430
there is no longer a single master samurai in existence.

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:01.310
What?!

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:03.100
I've never heard of that!

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:10.820
Three years ago, they fought the reincarnated Amakusa off the coast of Kyuushuu, and all seven died.

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.700
N-No way...

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:15.950
Of course, we cannot make such facts public knowledge.

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:20.200
Other countries will talk, and the people will panic.

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:21.120
Furthermore!

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:27.130
Even though Amakusa was defeated in the last fight, his presence still lingers!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:31.470
That woman called Gisen is obviously Amakusa's pawn.

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:34.970
This isn't good. This is far from good.

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:37.720
Sen, what would you do?

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:39.260
That's why.

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:41.390
That's why we need them.

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:44.810
My ultimate warriors, who will protect my Great Japan!

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:47.730
They are human pillars.

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:53.240
They are beautiful human pillars supporting the future of our country!

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:57.530
D'Artagnan, if you said so much to us, do you-

00:20:57.530 --> 00:21:01.950
Yes. I was ordered to execute all of you.

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:03.870
Please stop, Onii-sama.

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:05.120
Don't worry, Sen.

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:09.750
I won't kill you or these samples so easily.

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.050
Especially these two.

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:13.050
Sample Two
Sample One
Especially these two.

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:15.220
Muneakira, Jyuubei!

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:18.600
If I use the ultimate genes lying dormant within them,

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:24.180
my long sought dream of mass producing master samurai may not be far from realization!

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.600
Isn't it amazing, Sen?!

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:15.420
The protagonist, tsundere princess, and natural idiot are all gone!

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:17.800
My reign has finally come!

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:20.300
Now, if I can do something about that flat-chested loli...

00:23:20.300 --> 00:23:21.640
Who's a flat-chested loli?

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:26.640
Yukimura-san?! I'm not plotting to kill you at all!

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:27.770
Oh, I see.

00:23:27.770 --> 00:23:31.560
Perhaps the shadow covering Great Japan is actually you!

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:35.570
Yukimura-san, please put away that dangerous obj-

00:23:35.570 --> 00:23:38.150
Next time, Hyakka Ryouran: The Evil Eye Prison

00:23:38.150 --> 00:23:40.110
I'll be back!
